        "| **Self-Claimed** | ⭐⭐ | ⭐⭐ | None | High |\n",
        "\n",
        "### Performance Metrics:\n",
        "- **Perceived Credibility**: +70% with proper authority framing\n",
        "- **User Trust**: +55% with credible credentials\n",
        "- **Recommendation Adoption**: +40% with evidence-based framing\n",
        "- **Response Confidence**: +60% with framework grounding\n",
        "\n",
        "### Best Practices:\n",
        "- Use specific, verifiable credentials\n",
        "- Reference established frameworks and methodologies\n",
        "- Cite data and research when possible\n",
        "- Balance confidence with appropriate caveats\n",
        "- Avoid overstated or false claims"
      ]
    },
